SUMMARY:🎃🍂 PUMPKINS AFTER DARK – MARKHAM ROAD TRIP! 🍂🎃
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎃
 🍂 PUMPKINS AFTER DARK – MARKHAM ROAD TRIP! 🍂🎃\nSaturday\, Octob
 er 17\n\nLooking for the perfect pre-Halloween/Fall activity? One of our g
 roup members\, Emma\, suggested this cool idea — so we're heading out to
  Pumpkins After Dark in Markham! 🎃✨\n\nThis will be the FIRST TIME ou
 r Meetup group has done Pumpkins After Dark\, and it looks like a fantasti
 c way to get into the Halloween spirit!\n\n🌙 THE PLAN\n\nWe'll meet at 
 8:00 PM outside Christie Station and then head to Markham together in a re
 ntal SUV.\n\nThe road trip transportation includes:\n\n🚙 Round-trip tra
 nsportation from Toronto\n🎃 Transportation to and from Pumpkins After D
 ark\n👻 A fun evening with the group\n🍂 A perfect Fall/pre-Halloween 
 night out!\n\n💰 TRANSPORTATION: $25\n\nThe $25 covers your round-trip t
 ransportation only.\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANT: Your Pumpkins After Dark admissio
 n ticket is NOT included. You must purchase your own event admission separ
 ately.\n\n🎟️ Buy your Pumpkins After Dark ticket here:\n\nhttps://pum
 pkinsafterdark.com/markham\n\n🚨 RESERVE YOUR SPOT\n\nBecause we're usin
 g a rental SUV with limited space\, your spot is NOT locked in until I rec
 eive your $25 e-transfer.\n\n📧 E-transfer: nicolasbello@yahoo.com\n💵
  $25 per person\n\nPlease don't RSVP unless you're committed to coming and
  can send the $25 to secure your spot.\n\n🎃 WHY THIS WILL BE FUN\n\nThi
 nk giant glowing pumpkins\, Halloween displays\, crisp Fall weather\, musi
 c\, photos and a bunch of friends enjoying one of the most seasonal activi
 ties around.\n\nIt's basically the perfect excuse to start celebrating Hal
 loween before Halloween actually arrives! 👻🍂\n\nCome for the pumpkin
 s\, stay for the road-trip fun!\n\nFirst time for our group — let's make
  it a good one! 🎃🚙
