SUMMARY:🎤 Saturday Night Karaoke at The Frog! 🐸🎶
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🎤 
 Saturday Night Karaoke at The Frog! 🐸🎶\n\n**Ready to grab the mic\, 
 sing your heart out\, and enjoy a fun night out?**\nJoin us at The Frog on
  Yonge Street\, just north of Sheppard Avenue\, for a Saturday night of ka
 raoke\, drinks\, and great company!\n\nWhether you're a seasoned performer
  who knows how to work a crowd or someone who prefers singing along from t
 he audience\, everyone is welcome. You don't need to be a great singer —
  you just need to be ready to have some fun!\n\n🎵 **THE PLAN**\n📅 **
 Saturday\, October 17\, 2026**\n🕣 **Meetup time: 8:30 PM**\n🎤 **Kara
 oke: 9:00 PM – Midnight**\n🍻 **Happy hour on drinks after 10:00 PM**\
 n\nAccessiblilty- this venue is fully wheelchair accessible\n\nWe'll meet 
 up before the karaoke gets underway\, grab a spot\, socialize\, and get re
 ady for a night of musical entertainment. When the singing starts\, it's t
 ime to cheer on your fellow members — and maybe get up there and perform
  a song or two yourself!\n\n🍹 **BONUS: Happy hour starts after 10 PM!**
  So there's even more reason to stick around and enjoy the evening.\n\n**W
 HO SHOULD COME?**\n\n* People who love karaoke and singing along to their 
 favourite songs.\n* Anyone looking to meet new people and enjoy a relaxed 
 Saturday night.\n* Shower singers\, rock stars\, pop divas\, and everyone 
 in between!\n\nCome solo or bring your enthusiasm. You don't have to sing 
 to join us — cheering on the performers is just as welcome.\n\n📍 **LO
 CATION:** The Frog\, Yonge Street\, just north of Sheppard Avenue\, Toront
 o.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** Everyone is responsible for their own food and drin
 ks. Please drink responsibly.\n\nLet's make it a great Saturday night. Pic
 k your favourite song\, warm up those vocal cords\, and let's hear what yo
 u've got! 🎶🍻\nSuggested Meetup title: 🎤 Saturday Night Karaoke & 
 Happy Hour at The Frog! 🐸\n\n📩 **Questions?**\n\nContact **Colleen**
 \, your organizer\, by posting on the event page.
