SUMMARY:# 😂 FREE Stand-Up Comedy at Backroom Comedy Club! 🎤
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\nl\n# 
 😂 FREE Stand-Up Comedy at Backroom Comedy Club! 🎤\n\n**Sunday\, Octo
 ber 18 | 8:00 PM Show**\n\nWho says laughter has to cost money? 😂 We're
  heading to **Backroom Comedy Club** for a night of FREE stand-up comedy f
 eaturing a stacked lineup of Toronto comedians\, with the possibility of s
 urprise drop-ins!\n\nThanksgiving is over\, Halloween is almost here\, and
  it's time to get out\, meet some fun people\, grab a drink\, and enjoy so
 me live comedy.\n\n🎤 **What's the show like?**\n\n- A lineup of Toronto
 's best stand-up comedians.\n- Shorter sets and plenty of different comics
 .\n- The possibility of surprise guest appearances.\n- No two shows are ex
 actly alike!\n\nNot feeling one comedian? No worries — the next one will
  be up in minutes!\n\n🎟️ **Our Meetup Plan**\n\nNick will book **4 fr
 ee tickets for the 8:00 PM show** for our group.\n\n**IMPORTANT: VERY LIMI
 TED SPOTS!**\n\nPlease respect your RSVP. If you sign up\, you're committi
 ng to attend because our tickets are limited and someone else could take y
 our spot.\n\nWant to join us but missed out on the four group tickets? You
 're still welcome! You'll just need to **book your own free tickets direct
 ly with Backroom Comedy Club**.\n\nAccording to the club's invitation\, th
 ere are only 12 free seats per show\, and tickets are first come\, first s
 erved. You must receive confirmation of your tickets before heading over.\
 n\n📍 **Meeting up:** Look for Nick and the Meetup group. Exact meeting 
 arrangements will be shared with attendees.\n\n🍻 Grab a drink\, meet so
 me new people\, and enjoy a hilarious Sunday night out without spending a 
 fortune!\n\n**Come for the comedy\, stay for the laughs\, and let's make S
 unday night memorable!** 😂
